DESCRIPTION:Join us on Friday\, October 2 from 6 p.m. - 8 p.m. for the open
 ing reception of Creature Feature!\n\n \n\nExperience the mysterious\, the
  weird and the unexplained in this special Halloween exhibition featuring 
 various creatures of lore! From cute to creepy to fantastically freaky\, y
 ou will encounter a wide range of wild and weirdly-wonderous critters.\n\n
  \n\nThis juried exhibit features 35 works of various mediums from artists
  around the country and will be on display in the Mezzanine Level gallery.
  Please note: the Mezzanine Level is only accessible via the staircase.\n\
 n \n\nLight refreshments will be served during the reception.\n\nThe exhib
 ition will be available to view from October 1 - 31 at the UNT CoLab.
